{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misotextinput"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Text input is a UI element that allows to enter, edit, or select single-line textual data."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Text input is one of the most fundamental form elements used to capture user input such as names, emails, passwords, or search queries."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It provides a visual and interactive affordance for text entry while supporting labels, placeholders, icons, descriptions, and validation feedback."}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"kind":"relationships"}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextInput\/Helperlink","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextInput\/TrailingAction"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Structures","title":"Structures"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextInput\/init(_:tableName:bundle:text:placeholder:prefix:suffix:leadingImage:trailingAction:helperText:helperLink:isOutlined:constrainedMaxWidth:status:)-3rr11","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextInput\/init(_:tableName:bundle:text:placeholder:prefix:suffix:leadingImage:trailingAction:helperText:helperLink:isOutlined:constrainedMaxWidth:status:)-72xdt","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextInput\/init(label:text:placeholder:prefix:suffix:leadingImage:trailingAction:helperText:helperLink:isOutlined:constrainedMaxWidth:status:)-6fuf2","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextInput\/init(label:text:placeholder:prefix:suffix:leadingImage:trailingAction:helperText:helperLink:isOutlined:constrainedMaxWidth:status:)-6g04k"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextInput\/body"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextInput\/Status"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Enumerations","title":"Enumerations"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextInput\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextInput\/View-Implementations"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations"}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MISOTextInput","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:14MISOComponents13MISOTextInputV","title":"MISOTextInput","role":"symbol","platforms":[{"unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"15.0","beta":false},{"unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"macOS","introducedAt":"13.0","beta":false},{"unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"visionOS","introducedAt":"1.0","beta":false}],"roleHeading":"Structure","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOTextInput","kind":"identifier"}]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextInput"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOTextInput","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Layout","text":"Layout"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Text input is based on several configurable UI elements:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"label","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": It is used to describe the purpose of the input."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"In some UI contexts, especially when space is limited or when the input is part of a compact layout (search bars, filters, inline forms), the label can be hidden."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However, hiding the label should only be done if the purpose of the input remains clear thanks to a placeholder or contextual icon"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and if the label is still accessible to screen readers"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Hiding a label is a design choice that must balance visual simplicity and clarity of intent, without compromising inclusiveness or form guidance."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"placeholder"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": if the text of the text input is empty a placeholder provides a hint or guidance inside the field to suggest expected input.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A prefix and a suffix can be added to give more context.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"leading icon","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": it helps indicate the purpose of the input (magnifying glass for search, envelope for email, phone device for phone number).","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Only use a leading icon if it adds clear functional or contextual value.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"trailing action","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": it is used to provide actions related to the field: clear input, toggle password visibility, open a date picker, etc."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Can also indicate status or feedback (error checkmark, loading spinner)."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Outlined style","type":"heading","anchor":"Outlined-style","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"By ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"default","type":"text"}]},{"text":", the input is with a subtle background fill and invisible bottom border, creating a softer and more contained look.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Best suited for dense layouts or to enhance visibility.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"outlined","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":", the text input is a minimalist design with a transparent background and a visible stroke outlining the field.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This style may be interesting for contexts other than form pages:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When inputs need to feel lightweight and unobtrusive"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In a header (search field)"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In a selection\/filtering feature in a product catalog"}]}]}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["   \/\/ An outlined text input","   MISOTextInput(label: \"Label\", text: $text, isOutlined: true)","","   \/\/ With a localizable and a bundle","   MISOTextInput(LocalizedStringKey(\"label_wording\"), bundle: Bundle.module, text: $text)"]},{"text":"Rounded layout","type":"heading","anchor":"Rounded-layout","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Text input can have rounded layouts to be favored in more emotional, immersive contexts or those tied to specific visual identities."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For standard or business-oriented journeys, keep the default corners."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This evolution addresses the need for flexibility in adapting the design to some brand contexts."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To activate the rounded corner behavior, set to true the "},{"code":"hasRoundedTextInputs","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" values of the ","type":"text"},{"code":"Tuning","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" object","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in your theme configuration (if the theme exposes this property at init).","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Some themes do not have this flexibility, like ","type":"text"},{"code":"BlueCoatTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Status","text":"Status"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Five status are proposed for all layouts:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"default (by default)"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Default neutral appearance, whether empty or filled."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It allows users to click, focus, and type freely without restrictions."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"error"}]},{"text":": The ","type":"text"},{"code":"error","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" status indicates that the user input does not meet validation rules or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"expected formatting. It provides immediate visual feedback, typically through a red border,","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"error icon, and a clear, accessible error message positioned below the input. The error messages replaces the helper text."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"loading"}]},{"type":"text","text":": The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"loading"},{"type":"text","text":" state indicates that the system is processing or retrieving data"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"related to the text entered. A progress indicator appears to inform the user that an action is in progress."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"readOnly"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" :The"},{"code":"readOnly","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", lets the text visible but not editable"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"disabled"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": In "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"disabled"},{"type":"text","text":" status, the field is non-interactive and grayed out to indicate it cannot be changed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Note the SwiftUI "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View.disabled()"},{"type":"text","text":" is ignored."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Helpers","text":"Helpers"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Helper text"}]},{"type":"text","text":":  A supporting text conveys additional information about the input field,"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"such as how it will be used. It should ideally only take up a single line, though may wrap","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to multiple lines if required, and be either persistently visible or visible only on focus.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Helper link","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": If the helper text is not sufficient, it’s possible to offer the user","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"an additional help link (the link can be external or open a modal).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Accessibility considerations","anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"By default no haptics are done by the component for the trailing action."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However you should think about cases wher you will have to make the devices vibrates."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You can refer to the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/developer.apple.com\/design\/human-interface-guidelines\/playing-haptics","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Mandatory field indication","anchor":"Mandatory-field-indication","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If all fields are mandatory (several fields present): display the message “All fields are mandatory” at the top of your form.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Do not use an asterisk at the end of each field label, nor the word “mandatory.”","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If not all fields are mandatory (several fields present): display the message “All fields marked with an * are mandatory” at the top of your form.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Use an asterisk (*) at the end of each mandatory field label, and ensures this is well vocalized.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"UI rendering of the asterisk must be done with ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"bold font weight","type":"text"}]},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"negative content color"}]},{"text":" (red on light backgrounds).","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the mention “(optional)” at the end of each optional field label. Note that this rule is not systematic, it remains an option, to be used if needed."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If there is only one field in the form, or if the mandatory nature is obvious (such as login\/password),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"no mention is necessary since the fields are essential to the form’s functionality.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Rich text","anchor":"Rich-text","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Rich text can be used for error and helper texts."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Strong text can be used sparingly to highlight key information within the content.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"No other text styles should be used.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Underlined text must not be applied manually (e.g. in error message), as it is commonly associated with hyperlinks and may mislead users.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Code samples","anchor":"Code-samples","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ The text to display and edit","    @State var text: String = \"\"","","    \/\/ Empty text and no placeholder","    MISOTextInput(label: \"Email\", text: $text)","","    \/\/ Empty text with placeholder and suffix","    MISOTextInput(label: \"Email\", text: $text, placeholder: \"firstName.lastName\", suffix: \"@orange.com\")","","    \/\/ Empty text with prefix and suffix","    MISOTextInput(label: \"Email\", text: $text, prefix: \"Distance\", suffix: \"km\")","","    \/\/ Add a leading icon for more context","    MISOTextInput(label: \"Email\", text: $text, placeholder: \"firstName.lastName\", suffix: \"@orange.com\",","                  leadingImage: MISOImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"envelope\")))","","    \/\/ Add a leading icon displayed as raw image (not tinted)","    MISOTextInput(label: \"Brand\", text: $text,","                  leadingImage: MISOImage(asset: Image(\"ic_brand\"), renderingMode: .original))","","    \/\/ Flip the leading icon for RTL layouts using MISOImage.flipped","    MISOTextInput(label: \"Label\", text: $text,","                  leadingImage: MISOImage(asset: Image(\"ic_arrow\"), flipped: layoutDirection == .rightToLeft))","","    \/\/ Add a trailing button with local image named \"ic_cross\" for additional action","    let trailingAction = MISOTextInput.TrailingAction(image: MISOImage(asset: Image(\"ic_cross\")), actionHint: \"Delete\") { text = \"\" }","    MISOTextInput(label: \"Email\", text: $text, trailingAction: trailingAction)","","    \/\/ With helper text","    MISOTextInput(label: \"Email\",","                  text: $text,","                  placeholder: \"firstName.lastName\",","                  suffix: \"@orange.com\",","                  helperText: \"The email will be automatically completed with @orange.com\")","","    \/\/ With helper link","    @Environment(\\.openURL) private var openUrl","","    let helperLink = MISOTextInput.HelperLink(text: \"Helper Link\") {","       openUrl.callAsFunction(url)","    }","","    MISOTextInput(label: \"Label\", text: $text, placeholder: \"Placeholder\", helperLink: helperLink)"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If you need to flip your leading icon for RTL, use the ","type":"text"},{"code":"flipped","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" property of ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOImage"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["    @Environment(\\.layoutDirection) var layoutDirection","","    MISOTextInput(label: \"Label\", text: $text,","                  leadingImage: MISOImage(asset: Image(\"ic_arrow\"), flipped: layoutDirection == .rightToLeft))"],"type":"codeListing"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"1.4.1 (Figma component design version)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Version","style":"note","type":"aside"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS 0.20.0"}]}],"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Since"}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOTextInput/View-Implementations":{"title":"View Implementations","url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misotextinput\/view-implementations","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextInput\/View-Implementations","kind":"article","type":"topic","role":"collectionGroup"},"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/playing-haptics":{"url":"https:\/\/developer.apple.com\/design\/human-interface-guidelines\/playing-haptics","type":"link","title":"Human Interface Guidelines of Apple","identifier":"https:\/\/developer.apple.com\/design\/human-interface-guidelines\/playing-haptics","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Human Interface Guidelines of Apple"}]},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents":{"role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents","url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The catalog of all components provided by MISO. It contains also "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"text":" extensions and ","type":"text"},{"code":"ViewModifiers","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to apply tokens and styles on components and higher-level views.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png"}],"type":"topic","title":"Components"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOTextInput/TrailingAction":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextInput\/TrailingAction","kind":"symbol","title":"MISOTextInput.TrailingAction","